{"id":"n15804-1-10","stage":3,"title":"거꾸로 · 倒着","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15804-1-10-1","ko":"너 옷 거꾸로 입은 거 아냐?","zh":"你衣服穿反了吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"옷","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}},{"text":"거꾸로","meaning":"倒着，反着，颠倒地，逆转地","explanation":"거꾸로：倒着，反着，颠倒地，逆转地。","readings":[{"term":"거꾸로","audio":"/audio/b5400cfc533033e1a7f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15804","senseId":"1","lemma":"거꾸로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거꾸로","audio":"/audio/b5400cfc533033e1a7f3.mp3"}},{"text":"입은","meaning":"穿","explanation":"입다：穿；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"입다","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17174","senseId":"1","lemma":"입다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"입은","audio":"/audio/498d566b215f0ddb04af.mp3"}},{"text":"거","meaning":"某种事物、行为或情况（것 的口语形式）","explanation":"거 是 것 的口语形式，把前面的修饰内容概括为事物、行为或情况。这里不表示指示代词“那个”；具体的时态、疑问或推测语气结合前后的语尾理解。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}},{"text":"아냐?","meaning":"不是……吗？","explanation":"아냐 是 아니야 的缩合，来自 아니다，用疑问形式确认或推测前面的事实；这里不是 알다（知道）的活用。","readings":[{"term":"아니다","audio":"/audio/66b2ad55d8645d92ed83.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26878","senseId":"2","lemma":"아니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아냐","audio":"/audio/775fa206224d591e4b76.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"b5400cfc533033e1","term":"거꾸로","zh":"倒着，反着，颠倒地，逆转地","audio":"/audio/b5400cfc533033e1a7f3.mp3","entryId":"15804","definition":"顺序、方向、位置等变得相反地。","pronunciation":["거꾸로"]},{"id":"5e126f454a274733","term":"입다","zh":"穿","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3","entryId":"17174","definition":"将衣服披或裹在身上。","pronunciation":["입따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、行为或情况","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、行为或情况","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"66b2ad55d8645d92","term":"아니다","zh":"不是……吗？","audio":"/audio/66b2ad55d8645d92ed83.mp3","entryId":"26878","definition":"不是……吗？","pronunciation":["아니다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6c6268e4d26a6864a4d9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15804-1-10-2","ko":"원래 상표가 밖으로 나오게 입는 옷이야.","zh":"这种衣服本来就是商标要露在外的款式啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"원래","meaning":"原来，本来","explanation":"원래：原来，本来。","readings":[{"term":"원래","audio":"/audio/dc5331dd64d187d4a0fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53768","senseId":"1","lemma":"원래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"원래","audio":"/audio/dc5331dd64d187d4a0fd.mp3"}},{"text":"상표가","meaning":"商标","explanation":"상표：商标；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"상표","audio":"/audio/e0f0335e3cc98ef6c400.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16491","senseId":"1","lemma":"상표","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"상표가","audio":"/audio/abc4c8d26ffddd644af0.mp3"}},{"text":"밖으로","meaning":"表，表面","explanation":"밖：表，表面；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"밖","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17878","senseId":"2","lemma":"밖","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밖으로","audio":"/audio/811b71edf01aa148f58a.mp3"}},{"text":"나오게","meaning":"突出，凸出，突起","explanation":"나오다：突出，凸出，突起；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"23","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나오게","audio":"/audio/c807045a1e32f89bc6ba.mp3"}},{"text":"입는","meaning":"穿","explanation":"입다：穿；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"입다","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17174","senseId":"1","lemma":"입다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"입는","audio":"/audio/6ff4943ed6d134f3bae7.mp3"}},{"text":"옷이야.","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷이야","audio":"/audio/6c0895b9e9843b9337ef.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dc5331dd64d187d4","term":"원래","zh":"原来，本来","audio":"/audio/dc5331dd64d187d4a0fd.mp3","entryId":"53768","definition":"从一开始；或指从根本上。","pronunciation":["월래"]},{"id":"e0f0335e3cc98ef6","term":"상표","zh":"商标","audio":"/audio/e0f0335e3cc98ef6c400.mp3","entryId":"16491","definition":"标示制造商品的公司的记号或图画等标志。","pronunciation":["상표"]},{"id":"c54dd45d274b6e46","term":"밖","zh":"表，表面","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3","entryId":"17878","definition":"外面那一侧或外面部分。","pronunciation":["박"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"突出，凸出，突起","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"某个部分往前伸出来。","pronunciation":["나오다"]},{"id":"5e126f454a274733","term":"입다","zh":"穿"